    <fr:p><fr:link type="external" href="http://certora.com">Certora</fr:link> is a world-class smart contract auditing firm that uses the <fr:link type="external" href="https://www.certora.com/prover">Certora Prover</fr:link> to formally verify EVM and SVM smart contracts.</fr:p>
